  m_text: 'Buttons - Tap the icons to open up menus and options to restart the level.


    Starting the level - First select your starting possessed by tapping a villager.


    Movement - Slide your possessed Villgers to an adjacent space to move them there.


    Possessing - When Adjacent to a enemy (Unpossessed Villager) with one of your possessed, slide the space the enemy is on.


    Camera - In the empty space to the side of the gameboard, slide to rotate it around.'
